        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "应用信息"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                67,
                689,
                154,
                707
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5218FCL 是一款无频闪的线性恒流 LED 控制芯片，主要用于高压输入的各类光源和灯具的驱动，能够满足欧洲新 ERP 标准。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                715,
                484,
                772
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1 供电"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                67,
                782,
                131,
                799
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "在系统上电后，HV 通过内部的高压 JFET 给芯片供电，当 HV 的电压超过 10V 之后芯片开始工作。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                807,
                484,
                843
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2 恒流控制，输出电流设置"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                854,
                297,
                871
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5218FCL 可以通过外部电阻精确设定 LED 电流。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                65,
                878,
                410,
                894
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "当母线电压大于 LED 电压，母线给 LED 提供电流；当母线电压小于灯珠电压时，电解电容给 LED 放电。输出电流计算公式："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                510,
                715,
                929,
                752
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "I _ {\\mathrm{LED}} = \\frac {\\mathrm{Vref2}}{\\mathrm{Rcs2}}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/aeb44e3838ea1b6c8fcf062aaee3e2a6dca0e71e75a36126e8dca60c8e0c1f29.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                677,
                757,
                766,
                785
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3 过温调节功能"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                793,
                653,
                810
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "BP5218FCL 具有过热调节功能，在驱动电源过热时逐渐减小输出电流，从而控制输出功率和温升，使电源温度保持在设定值，以提高系统的可靠性。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                512,
                819,
                929,
                875
            ]
        },
